==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|харашо́||eye dialect, Internet slang}}

===Etymology===
From {{af|ru|хоро́ший|-о́}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|хорошо́}}
** {{audio|ru|Ru-хорошо.ogg}}
* {{IPA|ru|[xoroˈʂo]|a=Northern Russia}}
* {{IPA|ru|[xəraˈʂo]|;|[xɨraˈʂo]|a=Southern Russia}}  (''phonetic respelling'': хырашо́)
** {{IPA|ru|[xəraˈʂo]|;|[xraˈʂo]|a=Eastern}}  (''phonetic respelling'': храшо́)
