==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|еще́}}
* {{alter|ru|исчо́||misspelling}}

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*h₁es-}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*ešče|t=still, yet}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*h₁esk(ʷ)e(h₁)}}. Cognate with {{cog|be|яшчэ}}, {{cog|uk|ще}}, {{cog|pl|jeszcze}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-ещё.ogg}}

===Adverb===
{{ru-adv|ещё}}

# [[yet]], [[more]]
#: {{uxi|ru|всё '''ещё'''|still}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''ещё''' [[раз]]|once more}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''ещё''' [[не]]|not yet}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''ещё''' [[нет]]|not yet}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''ещё''' [[оди́н]]|another one}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''ещё''' [[бы]]|sure, of course, you bet}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[дать|да́йте]] [[я|мне]] '''ещё''', [[пожа́луйста]]|give me more, please}}
# [[else]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[что]] '''ещё'''?|what else}}
# [[still]]
#: {{uxi|ru|он '''ещё''' там|he's still there}}
# [[even]] (used with comparatives or to express frustration)
#: {{uxi|ru|он '''ещё''' глупе́е|he's even more stupid}}
#: {{uxi|ru|там '''ещё''' лу́чше|over there it's better still}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ru|всё ещё}}
* {{l|ru|ещё бы}}
* {{l|ru|ещё раз}}
* {{l|ru|тот ещё}}, {{l|ru|ещё тот}}

====Descendants====
